# CTL-SETTLE: DesertCtl's reply to a modeling Accept waits for the background compute however long it takes, as
# UE's Accept waits on HaveValidResult. The settle gate (ControlPipeline.hpp FrameGate) used to refuse after 240
# frames while PendingWork::ModelingAccept was still raised; it now waits on the bit with a wall-clock budget.
# Starter scene, Lit; a Box (plus a second overlapping Box, VoxBlend blends >= 2 inputs) selected -> VoxOps VoxBlend
# Union, Voxel Count 128 (8.8 s measured) -> Accept through DesertCtl must SUCCEED -> shot after the reply -> Undo.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.6,-0.45,0.65
Дано run Modeling "Create shape pivot: Centre"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,50,0
Дано run Modeling "Attributes tool: Edit Materials"
Дано run Modeling "Edit Materials active slot: 0"
Дано run Modeling "Edit Materials slot material: M_UVChecker"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 60,90,40
Дано run Modeling "Attributes tool: Edit Materials"
Дано run Modeling "Edit Materials active slot: 0"
Дано run Modeling "Edit Materials slot material: M_UVChecker"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Box2"
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Когда run Modeling "VoxBlend operation: Union"
Когда run Modeling "VoxBlend inputs: Hide Inputs"
Когда --subject modeling set VoxBlend.VoxelCount 128
Когда --subject modeling set VoxBlend.BlendFalloff 20
Когда run Modeling "VoxOps tool: VoxBlend"
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Когда state
Тогда 0_accepted one closed blended voxel mesh "Box VoxBlend" in the viewport (rounded joints, no holes), the VoxBlend tool closed, inputs hidden; the Accept reply succeeded (no "Accept rejected" / settle refusal)
Когда run Action Undo
Когда state
Тогда 1_undo the original checkered Box (and Box2) back with sharp joints, no blended mesh
